00:35:33.880 --> 00:35:36.300
in like the it on the way through the dust

00:35:36.300 --> 00:35:37.750
and the galaxy happened next

00:35:37.750 --> 00:35:39.580
and then through the atmosphere was next

00:35:39.580 --> 00:35:43.610
and then the telescope and
