00:35:43.610 --> 00:35:46.050
The causal structure is
usually really obvious.

00:35:46.050 --> 00:35:48.630
And when you get into
situations like medicine

00:35:48.630 --> 00:35:50.980
or social sciences and things like this,

00:35:50.980 --> 00:35:53.370
the causal structure is far from obvious.

00:35:53.370 --> 00:35:55.560
You know, you have no
